From dc3048030289fb8c0dcea60a9eaadf1fd91d3e13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ignaciopd3 <210892957+ignaciopd3@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:58:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 05/23] Thin line icons for the top bar and the weather

Inputs, Wi-Fi, Ethernet, the app library, Settings and the VPN locks drawn
as 1.5 strokes, and the weather icons thinned from 1.7 to 1.5, so the top
bar reads as one quiet set inside its capsule.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
